"@echo off\necho FiveWin Documentation Reorganization Script\necho ==========================================\n\necho.\necho Creating backup of docs directory...\nxcopy /s /e /i ..\\docs ..\\docs_backup\n\necho.\necho Moving Spanish documentation files to reference structure...\n\nREM Create reference directories if they don't exist\nif not exist \"..\\docs\\reference\\classes\" mkdir \"..\\docs\\reference\\classes\"\nif not exist \"..\\docs\\reference\\functions\" mkdir \"..\\docs\\reference\\functions\"\n\nREM Move class documentation\nif exist \"..\\docs\\TButton.md\" move \"..\\docs\\TButton.md\" \"..\\docs\\reference\\classes\\TButton.md\"\nif exist \"..\\docs\\TDialog.md\" move \"..\\docs\\TDialog.md\" \"..\\docs\\reference\\classes\\TDialog.md\"\nif exist \"..\\docs\\TControl.md\" move \"..\\docs\\TControl.md\" \"..\\docs\\reference\\classes\\TControl.md\"\nif exist \"..\\docs\\TWindow.md\" move \"..\\docs\\TWindow.md\" \"..\\docs\\reference\\classes\\TWindow.md\"\nif exist \"..\\docs\\TEdit.md\" move \"..\\docs\\TEdit.md\" \"..\\docs\\reference\\classes\\TEdit.md\"\nif exist \"..\\docs\\TListBox.md\" move \"..\\docs\\TListBox.md\" \"..\\docs\\reference\\classes\\TListBox.md\"\nif exist \"..\\docs\\TComboBox.md\" move \"..\\docs\\TComboBox.md\" \"..\\docs\\reference\\classes\\TComboBox.md\"\nif exist \"..\\docs\\TRadio.md\" move \"..\\docs\\TRadio.md\" \"..\\docs\\reference\\classes\\TRadio.md\"\nif exist \"..\\docs\\TCheckBox.md\" move \"..\\docs\\TCheckBox.md\" \"..\\docs\\reference\\classes\\TCheckBox.md\"\n\nREM Move function documentation\nif exist \"..\\docs\\functions\\alerts.md\" move \"..\\docs\\functions\\alerts.md\" \"..\\docs\\reference\\functions\\alerts.md\"\nif exist \"..\\docs\\functions\\database.md\" move \"..\\docs\\functions\\database.md\" \"..\\docs\\reference\\functions\\database.md\"\n\necho.\necho Reorganization complete. Remember to:\necho 1. Translate the moved files from Spanish to English\necho 2. Update the formatting to match the TEMPLATE.md\necho 3. Update any internal links to point to new locations\necho 4. Delete the backup when you're confident in the changes"